{'id':'BOOT','title':'Microsoft secure Windows boot process','url':'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/security/operating-system-security/system-security/secure-the-windows-10-boot-process','location':'Secure Boot; Measured Boot','verification':'Boot-signature policy is enforced by firmware; measurements are recorded using the TPM and may support attestation. Recording is not itself the same operation as enforcing boot acceptance.'},
